#amoeba_bond hippo-water-2021

> E = K2 dr^2 [1 + bond-cubic dr + bond-quartic dr^2], dr = R - R0

!Version  Ref  I   J   R0      K2
!-------  ---  --  --  ------  -------
 2021.1   1    HW  OW  0.9572  551.108

#amoeba_angle hippo-water-2021

> E = K2 dTheta^2 [1 + angle-cubic dTheta + ... + angle-sextic dTheta^4] (dTheta in degrees, K2 per radian^2)
> Theta0_2 / Theta0_3 apply when the center carries 1 / 2 further hydrogens

!Version  Ref  I   J   K   K2       Theta0_1  Theta0_2  Theta0_3
!-------  ---  --  --  --  -------  --------  --------  --------
 2021.1   1    HW  OW  HW  47.8253  104.52

#atomic_multipole hippo-water-2021

> Local frame from the bonded (or 1-3) atoms of the given types: Z X = z-then-x, -Z -X = bisector,
> Z -X -Y = z-bisect, -Z -X -Y = 3-fold, Z 0 = z-only, 0 = none; a fourth atom Y fixes the chirality
> dipole in e bohr, traceless quadrupole in e bohr^2 (atomic units, as in the papers and the Tinker files)

!Version  Ref  Type  Z    X    Y  Q          Dx        Dy   Dz         Qxx       Qxy  Qxz       Qyy        Qyz  Qzz
!-------  ---  ----  ---  ---  -  ---------  --------  ---  ---------  --------  ---  --------  ---------  ---  ---------
 2021.1   1    OW    -HW  -HW  0  -0.374842  0.0       0.0  0.054116   0.680265  0.0  0.0       -0.611121  0.0  -0.069144
 2021.1   1    HW    OW   HW   0  0.187421   0.008106  0.0  -0.200116  0.066936  0.0  0.007338  0.043814   0.0  -0.11075

