#reference 1
@Author xnn
J. A. Rackers, R. R. Silva, Z. Wang and J. W. Ponder, Polarizable Water Potential
Derived from a Model Electron Density, J. Chem. Theory Comput. 17, 7056-7084 (2021):
Table S1 of the Supporting Information (the 37 refined parameters), with the HIPPO
functional form of eqs 1-24 and Appendices A-C. Charge penetration, dispersion and
repulsion forms from J. A. Rackers et al., Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. 19, 276 (2017),
J. Chem. Phys. 149, 084115 (2018) and J. Chem. Phys. 150, 084104 (2019).

#end
